# The public half of the dedicated CI deploy key. Provisioning installs it for
# the deploy user only, forced to /usr/local/sbin/infra-deploy-gate.
# Generate it with:
#   ssh-keygen -t ed25519 -N '' -C infra-deploy -f ~/.ssh/infra-deploy
# then replace the line below with the contents of ~/.ssh/infra-deploy.pub
# (RUNBOOK.md, "New CI deploy key"). Provisioning refuses to run until then.
REPLACE_ME_BEFORE_DEPLOYING
